          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "derubare is built on rubare \"to steal\"; EtymDB links it with French dérober \"to steal\", from Old French desrober. Rubare goes back, through Medieval Latin, to a Frankish word for plunder (EtymDB)."
            }
          ]
        },
